<title>USA: Clinton news conference set for Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Clinton news conference set for Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. President Bill Clinton will hold a formal news conference at the White House on Wednesday at 2 p.m. EDT (1800 GMT), Press Secretary Mike McCurry said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The last formal news conference by Clinton alone at the White House was on March 7.</p>
